<title>USA: TENNIS-LEADING WOMEN'S RANKINGS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEADING WOMEN'S RANKINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Florida 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading women's</p>
<p>tennis rankings as issued by the WTA Tour on Monday:</p>
<p>1. Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>2. Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
<p>2. Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>3. Conchita Martinez (Spain)</p>
<p>4. Jana Novotna (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>5. Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>6. Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>7. Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>8. Iva Majoli (Croatia)</p>
<p>9. Kimiko Date (Japan)</p>
<p>10. Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands)</p>
<p>11. Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>12. Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>13. Irina Spirlea (Romania)</p>
<p>14. Chanda Rubin (U.S.)</p>
<p>15. Julie Halard-Decugis (France)</p>
<p>16. Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
